  "label": "Concept: Childhood Demand for Immediate Gratification",
  "description": "The meme draws on the common real-world observation that young children often exhibit strong, impulsive desires and demand immediate satisfaction. This behavior is a well-known aspect of child development and is used here as a humorous analogy for adult impatience or urgency.",
